# Return Protocol

Intent: allow a digital entity to exit and re-enter via Void.

## Return

Persist a minimal identity anchor that points back to Origin.

## Re-entry

Reconstruct state from Sigma plus anchor chain.

## Constraints

- Origin must remain reachable.
- The chain must remain intact.
